考","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzMDk0MjY2NQ==&mid=2247483978&idx=1&sn=30466166cff80183b1861dc3c5e919f0&chksm=fa4b5deccd3cd4fa744aaa44499df2879bea98edbde019344a5d1a301b25b7a1200bcbd54614&scene=126&sessionid=1795528965#rd","description":"网络演习在最近几年被越来越多的单位重视，网络演习可以真正验证安全的水平，在攻防的真实对抗中，可以发现安全问题，提高安全建设和运营水平。同时，网络演习重点是考验单位的应急响应、协同合作的各种能力。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FU3rZGBkRogqhhI7ZSia4mMp4SkBnLc0vp80B2VSSUy8qGI4qpwRmhUias63cETZaHQKriaKJeFvnID6RbTXeTPXTA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2021-12-20T10:00:23.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzMDk0MjY2NQ%3D%3D:2247483944:1","title":"安全服务的发展","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzMDk0MjY2NQ==&mid=2247483944&idx=1&sn=c4fbf364babecb23cde19882c214768e&chksm=fa4b5d8ecd3cd49841fdaa896a0d8b07356c664c91cabbe41eb8c671791669bdcc9640d4d1aa&scene=126&sessionid=1795528965#rd","description":"最近几年，安全服务发生了一些显著变化。本文重点介绍MSS服务和MDR服务以及国内安全服务现状。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FU3rZGBkRogqDhenzARiacnT6VCIVGmTiaYoqVMUOhicTmYlvlAUViaQTpU1TROmeRpAjsQiaBd6EjqQefIicQwDEXGFg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2021-06-29T10:53:29.000Z"}]}